<title>USA: Consolidated Gas unit wins 17 new leases.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Gas unit wins 17 new leases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Natural Gas Co said Friday its unit, CNG Producing Co, was high bidder on 17 lease tracts offered in the Texas General Land Office bidding held April 1 in Austin, Texas.</p>
<p>Consolidated said its unit bid $3.3 million for the tracts, comprising four prospects in the East Bay, Galveston Bay and Matagorda Island areas, all offshore Texas, in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>CNG Producing explores for and products natural natural gas and oil throughout the United States and Canada.</p>
</text>
